sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant Prefill as Prefill vLLM<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Decode as Decode vLLM<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant Proxy as Routing Proxy<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>8100/TCP
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTP/80
    GW->>EPP: GIE ExternalProcessor<br/>gRPC/9002
    Note right of EPP: Prefix-aware, load-aware<br/>routing decision
    EPP-->>GW: Selected backend endpoint
    GW->>Proxy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000
    Proxy->>Decode: Redirect to vLLM<br/>HTTP/8001

    opt Disaggregated Prefill
        GW->>Prefill: Forward to prefill node<br/>HTTP/8000
        Prefill->>Redis: LMCache KV lookup<br/>TCP/8100
        Redis-->>Prefill: Cache index response
        Prefill->>Decode: NIXL KV-cache transfer<br/>TCP/5557 (GPU-to-GPU)
    end

    Decode->>Redis: LMCache KV lookup<br/>TCP/8100
    Redis-->>Decode: Cache index response
    Decode-->>GW: Inference response
    GW-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: ModelService Reconciliation

    participant Controller as ModelService Controller<br/>8081/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CM as Preset ConfigMap

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch ModelService CRDs<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ModelService event
    Controller->>CM: Read preset template
    CM-->>Controller: Deployment template YAML
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Deployments, Services,<br/>InferencePool, InferenceModel, HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources created

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: Model Download (Init)

    Prefill->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, HF_TOKEN Bearer
    HF-->>Prefill: Model weights
    Decode->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, HF_TOKEN Bearer
    HF-->>Decode: Model weights
